<root-portal wx:if="{{visible}}">
<view class="pn-layer">
  <view class="pn-mask" catchtap="dismissOnce" catchtouchmove="noop" aria-hidden="{{true}}"></view>
  <view class="pn-card" catchtap="noop" role="dialog" aria-label="关于隐私和开源">
    <view class="pn-heading"><view class="pn-title">关于隐私和开源</view><button class="pn-close" aria-label="关闭隐私与开源说明" catchtap="dismissOnce">×</button></view>
    <scroll-view class="pn-body" scroll-y="{{true}}">
    <view class="pn-p">上传每天的用量数字、工具、模型和估算金额，以及同步程序的运行状态与版本。</view>
    <view class="pn-p">代码、对话、项目名和文件路径都不会收集上传。</view>
    <view class="pn-p">邮箱由你主动填写，仅用于用量日报登记，不公开展示，可随时撤销。</view>
    <view class="pn-p">参与公开排名后，头像昵称、用量及工具／模型偏好会展示在公开榜单和数据分析中。</view>
    <view class="pn-p">本项目已经全部开源，包含采集端、服务端，以及完整的小程序：</view>
    <view class="pn-repo" bindtap="copyRepo">
      <text class="pn-url">{{repo}}</text>
      <text class="pn-copy">复制</text>
    </view>
    <view class="pn-p pn-soft">不想上榜，可以在「我的」里关掉排名。</view>
    </scroll-view>
    <view class="pn-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-ghost pn-btn" catchtap="dismissForever">不再提示</button>
      <button class="btn btn-primary pn-btn" catchtap="dismissOnce">知道了</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
</root-portal>
